{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Droids You Are Looking For - DLC Models Package</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC package enhances your Sci-Fi TT RPG world-building and gaming by unlocking a detailed collection of 3D models inspired by <i>the droids you are looking for</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Desert Sci-Fi Buildings<br>-&quot;Ooo tee nee!&quot; Vehicles<br>-Speeders and Ships<br>-Walls and Floors<br>-Spaceship Wrecks<br>-And more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577650/extras/sw_gif.gif?t=1741863556\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiplayer Compatibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're a Game Master using this package, your players can view your maps online even if they don't own it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Disclaimer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This package is <strong><u>included</u></strong> in the Wrath of Devs Expansion. If you have backed that campaign, then you do not need to purchase this.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577650?t=1741863556","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577650/48aaea058acd2cde2c6fd2ac4afdf3e0c4ee46a2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741863556","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577650/88609dd732050892aa4de17c2ef77266b2e072f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741863556","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577650/88609dd732050892aa4de17c2ef77266b2e072f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741863556","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Workshop",